# faction-mix-waves.vrs: design §9 D60 / apocalypse D38, the allied groups of the faction wave templates (Epic A43).
# Each pass spawns 2 of each unit the group's templates name and 1 of each of its V Bloods at the pond with `.nyar spawn`,
# then Chaos stands 40 m east, invulnerable, for 60 s. Allied: no "died (killer CHAR_<group>" line for a manual unit in those
# 60 s (natives of another faction may still kill one; that is not this check), and every prefab still counts its units
# within 60 m. `.devkill` clears each pass (twice: spawns are staggered). Generated from Resources/templates.json; guids from
# Reference Data/unit_index.tsv. A failed pass names the group to drop from Logic/FactionGroups.cs.
# Needs: [Debug] VerboseLogging = true (the died line names its killer); NyarDevTools (.devgo .devtp .devmark .devunits
# .devkill), DevChatEcho; the pond mark; Chaos invulnerable (true only).
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
# pass militia (allied)
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 5
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 1
chat .devmark mix-militia
expect-log \[DEV MARK\] mix-militia
chat .nyar spawn CHAR_Militia_Light 2
expect-log spawn batch: .* 0 waiting timeout=30
wait 1
chat .nyar spawn CHAR_Militia_Crossbow 2
expect-log spawn batch: .* 0 waiting timeout=30
wait 1
chat .nyar spawn CHAR_Militia_Hound 2
expect-log spawn batch: .* 0 waiting timeout=30
wait 1
